commands that work
1) compile and link

    python -m numpy.f2py -c uvsing.pyf uvsing.f lamp.f -m uvsing

2) check that namespace exists

    nm -gU uvsing.cpython-312-darwin.so | grep uvsing

expected output

    0000000000006078 T _PyInit_uvsing
    0000000000000f60 T _uvsing_

3) check linked libraries
    otool -L uvsing.cpython-312-darwin.so
